# Build products. The Makefile writes binaries into the repo root and stages
# them to /tmp/nw-init-run; none of it belongs in git.
#
# Patterns, not a name list: this file previously enumerated each binary and
# fell behind twice when new targets were added (nw-dawn and unit-term).
# Every TCB binary is nw-* and every fixture is unit-*, while every source is
# nwcheck.c / nwspawn.c / nwsup.c / unit_probe.c -- underscores, no hyphen --
# so these patterns catch the products and no source.
*.o
nw-*
unit-*
.reviews/
*.gcov
*.gcno
*.gcda
